<section class="section"><div class="container"><h1 class="title">Frequently asked questions</h1><p>Generate content from text, a PDF, instructions, or a public web link on the creation page. Public links support HTML, Markdown and plain text.</p><p class="mt-4">Set quizzes to public to share their instance URL. The host can create accounts from Settings so participants can save their results.</p><p class="mt-4">Your API key and weekly spending limit are in <a href="/settings">Settings</a>. Blank limits mean unlimited; zero pauses AI requests. You can keep taking existing quizzes.</p></div></section>
